<h2>Unmatched ticket purchase</h2>
<p>
  An attendee has purchased a ticket, but the purchase does not match any
  current registration record — they may have registered with a different
  name or email, or not completed the registration form at all.
</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Email:</strong> {{ email }}</li>
  {% if full_name %}<li><strong>Name:</strong> {{ full_name }}</li>{% endif %}
  {% if order_id %}<li><strong>Order ID:</strong> {{ order_id }}</li>{% endif %}
</ul>
<p>
  <em>Action required:</em> open the dashboard and check the unmatched
  section to manually link this payment to a registration record, or
  contact the attendee if they have not registered yet.
</p>
